# Repo-root ignores.
#
# web-landing/.gitignore also lists `.env*`, but a .gitignore only governs its
# own directory and below - it never covered a file at the repo root. That gap
# is how /.env came to be committed in 6224aad. This file closes it for the
# root and for any sibling app added later.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS noise
.DS_Store
